					</div>
					<div class="col-lg-7">
						<div class="content" data-aos="fade-down" data-aos-delay="300">
							<h3 class="text-center">About the Envirotrax&reg; System</h3>
							<p>
								Since 2014, the Envirotrax&reg; system has helped to better manage cross-connection control
								and FOG programs for hundreds of cities, utility districts and water management companies.
								The robust Envirotrax&reg; management system is completely online, 100% free to the water
								purveyor, and extremely user friendly.
							</p>
						</div>

						<div class="content" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
							<h3 class="text-center">What is the Envirotrax&reg; System?</h3>
							<p>
								Envirotrax&reg; is a state-of-the-art online
								<span class="program steelblue">backflow prevention</span>,
								<span class="program cyan">customer service inspection (CSI)</span>, and
								<span class="program magenta">fats, oils, and grease (FOG)</span>
